      en: "Farms in the interior. Tobacco cultivation. Traditional agriculture. Vast landscapes. Important production. Thus, the site is among the characteristic points of Tanzania — an East African country shaped by Mount Kilimanjaro, the Serengeti, the Ngorongoro Crater, Lake Victoria and Lake Tanganyika, the Zanzibar archipelago along the Indian Ocean coast, and its wealth in coffee, cloves and gold mining — and offers insight into the regional identity. Located in the East African state of Tanzania, between the Indian Ocean and the Great Lakes region."
